    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 15th level, you show unparalleled control over your traps and utilize the openings they create.</p><p>You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You have advantage on weapon attacks against any creature who was hit by one of your traps since the end of your last turn.</p></li><li><p>Your traps no longer activates when a creature moves within range, instead you can choose as a free action to activate a trap, even if there is no creature nearby.</p></li></ul>",
